The baseline is stable and has no horizontal overflow, but two hierarchy problems stand out: on mobile the “Next up” action is buried below the entire map, and the latest video is rendered as a cramped chip rather than usable media. The HUD’s XP line also wraps awkwardly, and the current node uses multiple simultaneous idle animations. I’m tightening those areas while keeping the map and live bindings intact.
